    "detailed_description": "hello Seeing this, do you want to become an anime cute girl, Zhengtai to become a virtual UP master, virtual anchor or Vtuber?<br />\r\nvery simple! Let's start right away with this &quot;FaceWorldPro&quot; (*^_^*)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;FaceWorldPro&quot; is an application that only needs ordinary cameras and ordinary CPUs to perform facial expressions and motion capture to operate prefabricated or custom 3D avatars. Five-finger gesture recognition and half-body whole-body motion recognition that do not require motion capture equipment and depth cameras that only require ordinary cameras will also be developed soon. It has a wide range of application scenarios such as live broadcast, scenario animation, video and film creation, education, web conference, video chat, KTV, etc.<br />\r\nCompared with similar software, it supports weak light sources, face shielding such as glasses or even masks, and solves the problem of obvious lag and jitter during motion capture. Five-finger gesture recognition, half-body and full-body motion capture only rely on ordinary cameras without additional professional equipment.<br />\r\nNo need for joint callouts out of the box!",
